Package: pve-updater
Version: 0.9.0-3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), sudo, adduser, jq
Maintainer: it-koncept <it-koncept@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/it-koncept/Proxmox-VE-Updater-Gui
Description: GUI companion for the Proxmox VE guest updater (Bash engine)
 A narrow, authenticated web UI and job backend in front of update-vms.sh.
 The Bash engine remains the only component that changes packages; the
 backend only validates, queues and audits. Auth is delegated to the
 Proxmox VE REST API (tickets + CSRF + PVE ACLs); the root-side runner is
 invoked through an argument-free sudoers rule and re-validates every job.
 .
 This package is pre-release (0.x): production installs require maintainer
 approval. It never patches any Proxmox VE GUI file.
